    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Celebrate the spirit of the season with two of Canada’s most cherished acoustic acts—Shari Ulrich & The Unfaithful Servants—sharing the stage for a night of unforgettable acoustic magic. The Unfaithful Servants have been heralded as one of Canada’s"
