      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A male stripper parody and improv comedy show Presented by Roman Empire Productions The award winning improv comedians are back with a new show, more moves and even quicker wits. A SHOW FOR ALL GENDERS… 19+ ONLY WARNING! No extreme nudity, just"
