    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Back by popular demand! Visual storytelling virtuosos, the WONDERHEADS, present their signature reimagining of Charles Dickens’ classic A Christmas Carol. Bringing the magic of imagination to the stage, this unforgettable live experience features spectacular giant masks, whimsical puppets, and wondrous theatrical invention."
